    "description": "hands down one of the most authentic experiences you can do! \n\n📍 Odai Sushi\n🍣 A tiny family home turned into a sushi counter, where the chef serves what’s fresh that morning, piece by piece, in silence.\n🎌 No sign outside, no menu. Just decades of mastery hidden in a quiet Kyoto residential street.\n✅ 10 seats only. Walk-ins. Bring respect, it’s a residential area.\n\n📌 Save this for your next trip to Japan!",
